WEBVTT

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.591
and more hate tweets
than I can even count.

00:01:01.718 --> 00:01:04.869
I was called an idiot,
a traitor, a scourge,

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:07.595
a cunt and an ugly man,

00:01:07.715 --> 00:01:09.242
and that was just in one email.

00:01:09.377 --> 00:01:12.131
(Laughter)

00:01:12.195 --> 00:01:14.893
So what have I realized,

00:01:14.978 --> 00:01:17.549
being on the receiving end
of all this ugliness?

00:01:17.739 --> 00:01:19.373
Well, my biggest takeaway

00:01:19.398 --> 00:01:23.381
is that for decades, we've been focused
on political correctness,

00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:27.413
but what matters more
is emotional correctness.

00:01:27.993 --> 00:01:29.564
Let me give you a small example.

00:01:29.842 --> 00:01:32.548
I don't care if you call me a dyke.
I really don't.